Gemini 3.1 Pro also returned a graded failure on a different `easy` seed. One vendor remains; if it fails, the bare family hardens immediately at `easy`, and I’ll then use that exact shipping rung for both G9 comparison arms.
diff --git a/gen_2501_13534.py b/gen_2501_13534.py
index f66553c226ca950c83f2050da78399e31db07707..38d283ea52c30807fc8e2a1f1f150d3f6ae4a385
