codex
The OpenRouter key hit its total spending limit during the promoted `medium` bare rerun. Two distinct vendors had already returned graded failures there (Terra and Grok), but the required third attempt could not be drawn: every remaining provider returned HTTP 403, and the harness correctly refused to make a hardness claim. I will preserve all partial evidence and finish every local check/documentation item I can, but I cannot honestly produce the required medium bare/hinted/placebo verdicts without the external key limit being raised.
apply patch
