- [gen_2501_13534.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2501.13534/gen_2501_13534.py:34) implements the native Section 2.3 VT-syndrome decoder as Track B.
- G1–G8 pass. At medium, generic decoding costs about 437,000 operations versus 232 for the affine-moment route.
- G4 observed 0/200,000 hits; exact witness density is approximately \(1.75\times10^{-160}\).
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2501.13534/README.md:1) documents the construction, evidence, demo, and unresolved G9 run.
