The generator is implemented and locally verified, but cannot honestly ship yet.

- Track B family: VT power-syndrome deletion decoding from Section 2.3 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.13534).
- G1–G8 pass.
- Reference decoder: 437,032 median exact operations, 8/8 solved.
- Compact planted route: 232 operations.
- G4: 0/200,000 structured guesses; exact density ≈ `1.75e-160`.
- G9 size caps pass: 289 characters, 48 elements, ~97 tokens.
- G9 oracle evidence is incomplete, so `all_passed` remains `false`.

A fresh hardening attempt received HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded (total limit)` on every redraw, before any attempt could be scored. I did not fabricate transcripts, pass G9, or reject the paper.

